If a Bi-Implementor MF ACF2 driver exec cannot find an `ACF2CMD` variable, the sample code shows you should report an error and exit the script:
```
if wordpos("ADD_ACF2CMD.0", variablelist) <= 0; then do;
  success = IDMSTATS("error", "No ACF2 command found", EVENT_ID);
  exit 0;
end;
```
This uses IDMSTATS to return a status document with level `error` and halts further processing.

